Since I imagine it will be some time before we have any real checks with
DT schema, I did some simple checks with grep of compatible strings
being documented or not.

These results do have some false positives in cases where the compatible
string documentation has been parameterized such as
"fsl,<processor>-flexcan".

Compatible strings in arm dts:
928 compatible strings documented
476 compatible strings undocumented

Compatible strings in powerpc dts (for comparison which predates the
documentation requirement):
262 compatible strings documented
622 compatible strings undocumented

Compatible strings in the kernel source:
1093 compatible strings documented
531 compatible strings undocumented

The full listings are below.

